  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>X波段数传发射机组件</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Components.XBandTransmitterUnit</code>　<b>类型：</b>model</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>X波段数传发射机组件</p><h3>在工程中使用</h3><p>当前直接使用位置：<a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Systems.N_systems.CommunicationSystem\">OneSatSim.Systems.N_systems.CommunicationSystem</a> 的 <code>xband</code>。</p><h3>接口、输入与输出</h3><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>名称/维数</th><th>类型</th><th>声明角色</th><th>单位</th><th>含义</th></tr><tr><td><code>power</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.PowerPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>功率</td></tr><tr><td><code>thermal</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ThermalPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>热学</td></tr><tr><td><code>mechanical</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.MechanicalPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>机械</td></tr><tr><td><code>information</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.InformationPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 information</td></tr><tr><td><code>communicationPowerCommandFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.BooleanSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmitCommandFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.BooleanSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>dataAvailableFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.BooleanSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>informationRealBridge[3]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalBridge</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>实数因果输出到可扩展信息总线的无状态恒等桥实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>informationIntegerBridge[1]</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.IntegerSignalBridge</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>整数因果输出到可扩展信息总线的无状态恒等桥实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>activeGroundStationFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.IntegerSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线整数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>groundLinkReadyFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.BooleanSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>busVoltageFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线实数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>amplifierCurrentFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线实数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>storedBytesFromInformation</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.RealSignalReader</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>可扩展总线实数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr></table><h3>配置与参数</h3><p>下面列出当前源码表达式，仅用于阅读；当前参数对话框、生效配置记录与原有配置工具仍是使用依据。本页不新增默认值或换算。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>用途</th><th>源码表达式</th></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td>OneSatSim.Scenarios.DesignConfigRecords.XbandComponentConfig</td><td>由所属N-System传入的硬件设计配置</td><td><code>由调用方、继承或默认声明提供</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>powerAmplifierResistance</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance</td><td>功率放大器等效负载电阻；Excel单位Ω，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.PowerAmplifierResistance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>outputMatchResistance</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance</td><td>输出匹配串联损耗；Excel单位Ω，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.OutputMatchResistance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>paHeatCapacity</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.HeatCapacity</td><td>功放等效热容；Excel单位J/K，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.PAHeatCapacity</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>radiatorConductance</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.ThermalConductance</td><td>功放散热导热；Excel单位W/K，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RadiatorConductance</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>mass</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Mass</td><td>质量；Excel单位kg，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Mass</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_X</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置X；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_X</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_Y</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置Y；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_Y</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>rcm_Z</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Length</td><td>质心偏置Z；Excel单位m，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.RCM_Z</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_XX</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Ixx；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_XX</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_YY</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Iyy；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_YY</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>inertia_ZZ</code></td><td>Modelica.Units.SI.Inertia</td><td>局部惯量 Izz；Excel单位kg·m²，当前设计基线</td><td><code>=config.Inertia_ZZ</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>nominalPayloadDataRate</code></td><td>Real</td><td>任务级50 Mbps载荷下传速率；数值单位：byte/s</td><td><code>=config.NominalDataRate</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>highPerformancePayloadDataRate</code></td><td>Real</td><td>可选150 Mbps高性能配置；数值单位：byte/s</td><td><code>=config.HighPerformanceDataRate</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>useHighPerformanceDataRate</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>useHighPerformance数据速率</td><td><code>=config.UseHighPerformanceDataRate</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>payloadDataRate</code></td><td>Real</td><td>当前载荷下传速率；数值单位：byte/s</td><td><code>=if useHighPerformanceDataRate then highPerformancePayloadDataRate else nominalPayloadDataRate</code></td></tr></table><h3>内部组成</h3><p>以下为本类直接声明的组成单元，继承类的内部结构另按其文档查看。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>实例</th><th>类</th><th>作用</th></tr><tr><td><code>unused5Rail</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 unused5Rail</td></tr><tr><td><code>unused33Rail</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Conductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 unused33Rail</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmissionLogic</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.XBandTransmissionCalculation\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Calculations.XBandTransmissionCalculation</a></td><td>X波段发射任务门控计算实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmitEnable</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Ideal.IdealClosingSwitch</a></td><td>计算/接口量 transmitEnable</td></tr><tr><td><code>paCurrent</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.CurrentSensor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.CurrentSensor</a></td><td>pa电流</td></tr><tr><td><code>powerAmplifier</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor</a></td><td>功率Amplifier</td></tr><tr><td><code>outputMatch</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor\">Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Resistor</a></td><td>输出Match</td></tr><tr><td><code>paNode</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.HeatCapacitor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.HeatCapacitor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 paNode</td></tr><tr><td><code>radiatorPath</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.ThermalConductor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Components.ThermalConductor</a></td><td>计算/接口量 radiatorPath</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmitterTemperature</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor\">Modelica.Thermal.HeatTransfer.Sensors.TemperatureSensor</a></td><td>X波段功放温度</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmitterBody</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body\">Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Parts.Body</a></td><td>transmitter本体</td></tr></table></html>"
